%% Figure 12 / Chapter Figure 4.9 - HR Verification and Eligibility Activity Diagram
flowchart LR
    Start([Start]):::terminal
    Queue["Open HR master queue"]:::process
    Select["Select application"]:::process
    Staff["Confirm staff record and rank history"]:::process
    Doc["Verify uploaded evidence documents"]:::process
    Valid{"Document valid?"}:::decision
    Reject["Reject or request correction"]:::exception
    Required{"Required categories verified?"}:::decision
    Wait["Keep under HR verification"]:::exception
    Engine["Run eligibility engine"]:::process
    Score["Compute criteria score from verified evidence"]:::process
    Outcome{"Eligibility outcome"}:::decision
    Committee["Route eligible file to committee"]:::process
    Further["Mark not eligible or requires further review"]:::exception
    Audit["Save verification, audit trail, status history, and notifications"]:::audit
    End([End]):::terminal

    Start --> Queue --> Select --> Staff --> Doc --> Valid
    Valid -- No --> Reject --> Audit --> End
    Valid -- Yes --> Required
    Required -- No --> Wait --> Audit --> End
    Required -- Yes --> Engine --> Score --> Outcome
    Outcome -- Eligible --> Committee --> Audit --> End
    Outcome -- Not eligible / further review --> Further --> Audit --> End

